ews tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-harwich-cultural-center tag-hollis-fortune tag-karla-carillo\" id=\"post-3191\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/open-house-art-show-sale/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"387\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A flyer for the open house art show and sale.\" src=\"/media/archive/3269b027304f596007605541716e5f6eff042482c54b784595d357331b9ce447.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/open-house-art-show-sale/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Open House Art Show &amp; Sale, July 27 – 29</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-19T18:48:56-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, July 19, 2017, 6:48 pm\">July 19, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists members Karla Cardillo, Hollis Fortune, and Donna Julian Spillane are among the participating artists at the Harwich Cultural Center Open House, July 27 – 29.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
